------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Development disclosure
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parts of this product were written or revised with the assistance of an AI
system (Claude Mythos 5.1, Anthropic) operating under the direction and
review of the maintainer. Commits carry a Co-Authored-By trailer where that
applies. An AI-assisted security review and its remediation are recorded in
audits/README.md with the reviewed commit and timestamps. That review is not
a substitute for independent human cryptographic review, and no warranty is
implied by it.

The formal proofs in proofs/ were machine-checked with Rocq (Coq) 9.1. They
establish functional correctness of the branchless arithmetic, not the timing
of compiled code; see README.md, "Security".
